{title: Jaanu Meri Jaan}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Jaanu meri [E]jaan,        [A]main tere qur [E]baan
[A]main tera tu [D]meri jaane,        [A]saara Hindus [G]taa [A]aan
[A]Gusse se hai pyar bada,        [A]pyar se aetbaar
[Bb]jab aa jaaye [A]aa jana mey,        [E]karunga inte [A]zar
Jaanu meri jaan...        [A]Nazron se na tol mujhe
[A]dil se kaam le,        [Bb]tu jiski woh [A]tere bin kyun
[E]kisika naam [A]le,        Jaanu meri jaan...
